# Defect 2043, 2026-10-13. A constant whose body is literals is laid out once
# by clang (defect 382), and the function that reads it returned its address
# from a line of the generated C: a `step` into `DIGITS` stopped in that file,
# and a breakpoint on the `constant` line resolved to no location at all. The
# return is now the constant's own line, so a `step` into it stops there, as
# a step into any function stops on its `function` line, `finish` comes back
# to the reading line, and a breakpoint on the constant's line holds.

constant DIGITS: [i64]
    [3, -1, 4]

function main()
    first = DIGITS[1]
    last = DIGITS[2]
    print(first + last)
